    "Security patches for transitive dependencies. npm audit suggests DOWNGRADES",
    "for these (next@9.3.3, sanity@5.14.1, next-sanity@0.8.5) because it cannot",
    "find a forward fix -- never run `npm audit fix --force` on this project.",
    "Each override is scoped to the vulnerable range, so already-safe copies",
